#: src/lib/boardInfo.ts:416
msgid "A Muster puts a rider on one of its six paths"
msgstr "征召会把一名骑兵放到它的六条路段之一上"

#: src/routes/HowToPlay.tsx:4848
msgid "A Muster with nothing to place, because you have no rider left or every castle path is taken, is discarded with no effect. It is not held, not refunded, and does not draw a replacement. Only Intrigue redraws, because only Intrigue says so."
msgstr "没有东西可放的征召（因为你没有剩余骑兵，或者城堡的每条路段都已被占）会被弃掉且没有效果。它不会被保留，不退款，也不会补抽一张。只有阴谋会重抽，因为只有阴谋写明了这一点。"

#: src/routes/HowToPlay.tsx:1278
msgid "A new ship must <0>extend your own network</0>: place it next to one of your ships, or out from one of your coastal settlements or cities, on any island you occupy. An opponent's settlement or city on an intersection <1>cuts your chain</1> there, exactly as it cuts a road."
msgstr "新船必须<0>延伸你自己的网络</0>：放在你某艘船旁边，或从你在任意已占据岛屿上的沿岸村庄或城市向外延伸。对手的村庄或城市建在某个路口上会在那里<1>切断你的链条</1>，与切断道路完全一样。"

#: src/routes/HowToPlay.tsx:2026
msgid "A newly built knight is <0>inactive</0>, and activating it costs wheat and locks it for that turn, so a knight is never useful the turn you build it."
msgstr "新造的骑士处于<0>未激活</0>状态，激活它要花小麦，而且当回合被锁住，所以骑士在你建造它的那个回合永远派不上用场。"

#: src/routes/HowToPlay.tsx:4745
msgid "A number that names <0>no</0> eligible coastal hex places nothing, and is <1>not re-rolled</1>. It still counts as one of the three."
msgstr "没有指到<0>任何</0>符合条件沿海地块的点数不放置任何东西，并且<1>不重新掷骰</1>。它仍算作三次之一。"

#: src/routes/HowToPlay.tsx:4869
msgid "A path holds at most one rider. Riders and roads share a path freely, in either order, and neither blocks the other. A rider never affects the distance rule, never blocks a settlement, and never breaks a road."
msgstr "每条路段至多一名骑兵。骑兵和道路可以自由共享一条路段，先后不限，互不阻挡。骑兵从不影响间距规则，从不阻挡村庄，也从不截断道路。"

#: src/routes/HowToPlay.tsx:1019
msgid "A path may not reuse the same road twice, but it <0>may pass through the same intersection twice</0>, which is why a loop counts every one of its segments."
msgstr "一条路径不能重复使用同一条道路，但它<0>可以两次经过同一个路口</0>，这正是环形路线的每一段都计入的原因。"

#: src/routes/HowToPlay.tsx:2394
msgid "A path with no road on it"
msgstr "没有道路的路段"

