msgid "Most of them <0>compose</0>, with each other and with Islands and Knights, and a table may run several at once. Running Fishermen and Caravans together is a supported combination, and the two meet at the desert: Fishermen floods it, so the Caravans oasis <1>is</1> the lake, growing camels out of a hex that is also a fish source. Where a pair does not work the lobby greys the second switch out and says why; the refusals are listed at the end of this chapter."
msgstr "其中大多数可以<0>组合</0>，既能相互组合，也能与群岛和骑士扩展组合，一张牌桌可以同时启用好几个。渔夫和商队同玩是受支持的组合，两者在沙漠处交汇：渔夫把沙漠变成湖泊，所以商队的绿洲<1>就是</1>这片湖泊，骆驼从一个同时也是渔获来源的地块中延伸出来。某一对不能搭配时，房间会把第二个开关变灰并说明原因；被拒绝的组合列在本章末尾。"

