#: src/routes/HowToPlay.tsx:4686
msgid "Raiders turns the base game inside out. A hostile force lands on the coast, hex by hex, every time <0>anybody</0> builds. Hexes it saturates stop producing, buildings it surrounds stop scoring, and you answer by putting <1>riders</1> on the board and marching them to the coast. The arithmetic of a battle is table-wide, so defending is usually a joint effort between two or three players who then argue over the spoils."
